<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
	<Import Project="..\Nalix.Build.props" />

	<PropertyGroup>
		<TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>

		<Nullable>enable</Nullable>
		<IsPackable>false</IsPackable>
		<IsTrimmable>false</IsTrimmable>
		<OutputType>Library</OutputType>

		<!-- NativeAOT: export UnmanagedCallersOnly symbols as a real DLL/.so/.dylib -->
		<Optimize>true</Optimize>
		<TrimMode>partial</TrimMode>
		<PublishAot>true</PublishAot>
		<StripSymbols>true</StripSymbols>
		<Deterministic>true</Deterministic>
		<IsAotCompatible>true</IsAotCompatible>
		<InvariantGlobalization>true</InvariantGlobalization>

		<NativeLib>Shared</NativeLib>
		<SelfContained>true</SelfContained>
		<NativeLibraryName>Nalix</NativeLibraryName>

		<!-- Reduce reflection metadata; keep it small & fast for interop -->
		<IlcOptimizationPreference>Speed</IlcOptimizationPreference>
		<IlcGenerateCompleteTypeMetadata>false</IlcGenerateCompleteTypeMetadata>

		<RuntimeIdentifiers>
			win-x64;win-arm64;
			linux-x64;linux-arm64;
			osx-x64;osx-arm64;
			android-arm64;android-x64
		</RuntimeIdentifiers>

		<Description><![CDATA[
Nalix.SDK.Native is the native AOT interop layer for the Nalix ecosystem.
It provides a clean, stable C ABI (via UnmanagedCallersOnly) allowing Java (JNI/JNA), C/C++, Rust, Python, Go, and other languages to consume high-performance Nalix networking functionality.

Features:
• High-performance TcpSession with cryptographic X25519 handshakes, AEAD symmetric encryption, and frame parsing.
• Event callback bindings for transport lifecycle events (OnConnected, OnMessage, OnError, OnDisconnected).
• Protocol extension utilities: dynamic runtime cipher suite updates, sub-millisecond round-trip ping measurements, network-wide time synchronization, session resumption, and control frame dispatch.
• Thread-safe unmanaged error tracking (LastError) for easy foreign function interface (FFI) integration.
		]]></Description>

		<PackageReleaseNotes><![CDATA[
- Native AOT Export: Stable C ABI exports using Cdecl calling convention.
- TcpSession interop support: Connect, Send, Handshake, Disconnect, and Free.
- Event Callback bindings: Full support for OnConnected, OnMessage, OnError, and OnDisconnected events.
- Advanced Protocol Utilities: Support for ConnectWithResume, Handshake, DisconnectGraceful, Ping, SyncTime, ResumeSession, UpdateCipher, and SendControl.
- Thread-safe Diagnostics: Retrieve last exception messages via GetLastError and FreeError.
- Multi-RID publishing support (Windows, Linux, macOS, Android).
		]]></PackageReleaseNotes>

		<AllowUnsafeBlocks>true</AllowUnsafeBlocks>
		<GeneratePackageOnBuild>false</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
	</PropertyGroup>

	<ItemGroup>
		<ProjectReference Include="..\Nalix.SDK\Nalix.SDK.csproj" />
	</ItemGroup>
</Project>
